:: Abandoned Subway Intro
<<set $location to "underground">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>>
<<set $subway_darkness = Math.clamp($subway, 0, 100)>>
<<set $subway_darkness = 0>>
<<set $subway_intro = 1>>
You pry open the door and push your way into a dark maintenance tunnel, up ahead you see lights. (write something about discovering the subway here)
<br><br>

	<<link [[Walk towards them|Subway Central Station]]>><</link>><br>
	<<link [[Leave|Commercial Drain]]>><</link>><br>




/* High street - both lines */
:: Subway Central Station 
<<set $location to "underground">><<set $bus to "subwaycentralstation">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>>
You are in the old central station of the abandoned subway network, the eerily abandoned interior is dimly lit by some old maintenance lights that somehow still have power.
<br>
<<subway_darkness>>
/*<<subwaydescription>>*/
<br><br>
<<subwaylinks>>
<<set $eventskip to 0>>




/* domus street - red line */
:: Subway Residential Station 
<<set $location to "underground">><<set $bus to "subwayresidentialstation">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>>
You are in an abandoned station that was once the residential district connection to the subway line. the door to the surface has long been sealed.
<br>
<<subway_darkness>>
<br><br>
	
<<subwaylinks>>
<<set $eventskip to 0>>


