:: Subway Vampire Room
<<set $location to "underground">><<set $bus to "subwayvampireroom">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>>
<span class="lblue">You have entered a strangely decorated dark room.</span> A decayed wooden coffin sits in front of you, you have a feeling that you probably shouldn't disturb it.
<br><br>

	<<if !$weekly.abandonedsubwayBlastingCap>>
		<<link [[Open Coffin (0:10)|Subway Open]]>><<pass 10>><<set $weekly.abandonedsubwayBlastingCap to true>><</link>><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[Exit to Station (0:10)|Subway Industrial Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>






:: Widgets Subway Descriptions [widget]

/* <<widget "subwaydescriptions">>
	<<if $weather is "rain">>
		Water surges down the centre, almost flooding the thin walkways on each side.
	<<elseif $weather is "snow">>
		Water rushes down the centre, carrying chunks of ice.
	<<else>>
		Water rushes down the centre, flanked by a thin walkway on each side.
	<</if>>
	<<wHunt "drain">>
	<br><br>
	You can access several parts of town from here.
	<br><br>
	<<if isPubfameTaskAccepted("morgan")>>
		'Mickey' said the USB was somewhere in the sewer system, and that they think <<if $sewersintro is 1>>Morgan has it.<<else>>someone down there has it. You notice a ladder leading down.<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>> */

<<widget "subwaylinks">>
	<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
		<<passoutsubway>>
	<<else>>
		<<rng>>
		<<if ($weather is "rain" or $weather is "snow") and $rng gte 75 and $eventskip is 0>>
			/*<<eventssubway>>
		<<elseif ($rng gte 92 or $eventforced) and $eventskip is 0>>
			<<eventssubway>>*/
		<<else>>
			<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax and $bus isnot "vampireroom">>
				<<orgasmLocation "subway">>
			<</if>>
			<<switch $bus>>
				<<case "subwaycentralstation">>
					<<centralstationlinks>>

				<<case "subwayresidentialstation">>
					<<residentialstationlinks>>

				<<case "subwayindustrialstation">>
					<<industrialstationlinks>>

				<<case "subwaydocksstation">>
					<<dockstationlinks>>

				<<case "subwaymilitarystation">>
					<<militarystationlinks>>

				<<case "subwayfarmstation">>
					<<farmstationlinks>>

				<<case "subwaycastlestation">>
					<<castlestationlinks>>

				<<case "subwaymineshaftstation">>
					<<mineshaftstationlinks>>

			<</switch>>
		<</if>>
		<<displayLinks>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "centralstationlinks">>
	<<link [[Walk to Residential Station (0:10)|Subway Residential Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
	<<link [[Walk to Industrial Station (0:10)|Subway Industrial Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
	<<link [[Walk to Docks Station (0:10)|Subway Docks Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br><br>

	<<link [[Exit to Storm Drains (0:10)|Commercial Drain]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "residentialstationlinks">>
	<<link [[Walk to Central Station (0:10)|Subway Central Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
	<<link [[Walk into the lit mineshaft(0:30)|Mines Intro]]>><<pass 30>><</link>><br>
	<<link [[Walk into the dark mineshaft(0:30)|Subway Forest Mineshafts]]>><<pass 30>><</link>><br><br>

	<<link [[Exit to Storm Drains (0:10)|Residential Drain]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "industrialstationlinks">>
	<<link [[Walk to Central Station (0:10)|Subway Central Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>

	<<if $vampire_room_discovered is undefined>>
		<<link [[Investigate hole in wall (0:10)|Subway Vampire Room]]>><<pass 10>><<set $vampire_room_discovered to 1>><</link>><br><br>
	<<else>> 
		<<link [[Enter Coffin Room (0:10)|Subway Vampire Room]]>><<pass 10>><<set $subway_darkness += 20>><</link>><br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[Exit to Storm Drains (0:10)|Industrial Drain]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "dockstationlinks">>
	<<link [[Walk to Central Station (0:10)|Subway Central Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
	<<link [[Walk to Farmlands (1:30)|Subway Farmlands Station ]]>><<pass 90>><</link>><br><br>

	<<link [[Exit to Storm Drains (0:10)|Drain Exit]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "militarystationlinks">>
	<<link [[Walk towards town (0:20)|Subway Farmlands Station]]>><<pass 20>><</link>><br>
	<<link [[Walk through crack in wall (1:30)|Subway Hawk Castle Cave]]>><<pass 90>><</link>><br>

	/* Bunker link */

<</widget>>

<<widget "farmstationlinks">>
	<<link [[Walk to Military Base (0:20)|Subway Moor/Military Station ]]>><<pass 20>><</link>><br>
	<<link [[Walk towards town (0:10)|Subway Docks Station]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br><br>

	<<link [[Exit through hole to surface (0:10)|Farmland]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "castlestationlinks">>
	<<link [[Walk towards town (1:30)|Subway Military Base]]>><<pass 90>><</link>><br>

	/* Moor Castle link */
<</widget>>

<<widget "mineshaftstationlinks">>
	<<link [[Walk towards town (0:30)|Subway Residential Station]]>><<pass 30>><</link>><br>

	<<link [[Exit old Mineshafts (0:10)|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<</widget>>










:: Subway Open
<<effects>>

You open the old crate. Inside is a pile of old machinery and tools, but something catches your eye. you pick up some kind of old device of unknown use, someone in the museum might know what it was used for.
<<set $antiquemoney += 2500>><<museumAntiqueStatus "antiqueblastingcap" "found">>
<br><br>
<<set $pursuit += 1>>
<<if $museumAntiques.antiques.antiqueconductorwhistle isnot "found" and $museumAntiques.antiques.antiqueconductorwhistle isnot "talk" and $museumAntiques.antiques.antiqueconductorwhistle isnot "museum">>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1000>>
	<<caveicon "treasure">><<link [[Examine the crate more closely|Abandoned Subway Examine]]>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Leave|Subway Vampire Room]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Abandoned Subway Examine
<<effects>>


You sort through the rest of the contents of the crate, searching for something of value.
<br><br>

<<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	/*<<earnFeat "X Marks the Spot">>*/
	After a number of minutes searching through the debris you see a near imperceptible spot of shiny metal underneath the rusted tools, upon rummaging to the bottom of the crate you manage to grab hold of whatever it was. <span class="green">you pull out an old silver whistle</span> from the base of the container.
	<br><br>
	<<set $antiquemoney += 4000>><<museumAntiqueStatus "antiqueconductorwhistle" "found">>
	You inspect the whistle, it appears to be a conductor's whistle from when the subway planned to open, it might be valuable.
	<br><br>
	<<skulduggeryuse>>

	<<link [[Next|Abandoned Subway]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<<else>>

	As you are searching the crate one of the maintenance lights fails leaving the area in absolute darkness, the crate is too heavy to move and unable to see its contents you have to move on.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<skulduggeryuse>>

	<<link [[Next|Abandoned Subway]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<</if>>



:: Passout Subway

You've pushed yourself too much.
<br><br>
<<passout>>
<<ambulance>>
<<pass 1 hour>>
<<trauma 6>><<set $stress -= 2000>>



